    "detailed_description": "&quot;The one who came to meet me as I attempted suicide was a pure white grim reaper.&quot;<br><br>&quot;A visual novel ensemble drama gift for those who find living in the present difficult.&quot;<br><br>Game Overview<br>A visual novel game themed around life and the human psyche, dedicated to those struggling to live in today's challenging times. This is a story searching for the answer to why we live.<br><br>Synopsis<br>&quot;The one who came to greet me in my final moments was a pure white grim reaper...&quot;<br>She speaks of ancient tales akin to the Arabian Nights.<br><br>The protagonist, Shataro, suffers from insomnia, spending each night unable to sleep. Suddenly, a pure white girl, a 'shinigami,' appears before him. She promises to tell him ancient tales every night until he can fall asleep again... But these tales reveal the sins and punishments he has committed.<br><br>Until his anger subsides, she continues to speak.<br>Until his sins are purified, until this body is cleansed...<br>Until &quot;you&quot; can forgive him.<br><br>Cast<br><br>[Voice Actors]<br>Karta: Rie Tanaka<br>Garland: Roa<br><br>Tsukuyo: Ichigo Koyama<br>Kosuke: Yuuki Igarashi<br>Haruki: Mame\u266a<br>Sakana: Koto Furuto<br>Kotomi: Yuzuko Konoe<br>Tsugumi: Tomokono<br>Kaguya: Asano Ruri<br>Tsukimi: Yanagi<br>Utarou: Mario Hikoda<br><br>[Theme Song]<br>Haruka Shimotsuki &quot;Poem of the White Grim Reaper&quot;<br><br>[Ending Song]<br>Momo Mizuki &quot;Song of the Blue Rose&quot;",
